{"availability":"available","full":"sunnypatell/sunnify-spotify-downloader","name":"sunnify-spotify-downloader","description":"Sunnify is a Spotify downloader application + CLI that allows you to download entire playlists locally onto your Mac/Linux/Windows PC.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1201,"forks":52,"created":"2024-02-12T17:21:03Z","updated":"2026-10-05T16:20:55Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://sunnify-spotify-downloader.vercel.app","topics":["desktop-app","mp3","music-downloader","playlist-downloader","python","spotify","spotify-downloader"],"demo":"https://sunnify-spotify-downloader.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:02.560Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:02.560Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:02.560Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T09:02:02.560Z","stars":1201,"forks":52}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Free, open source, cross-platform. Point-and-click desktop app with a built-in headless CLI. No account, no subscription.","Educational / student portfolio project. Sunnify is a technical demonstration, not a piracy tool. Use it only for content you own or are permitted to download, and only where doing so is legal in your jurisdiction. See the full legal disclaimer and DISCLAIMER.md.","Sunnify is a free, open-source Spotify playlist downloader for macOS, Windows, and Linux. Paste any Spotify playlist, album, or track link and Sunnify saves it as local audio files (MP3, M4A, FLAC, Opus, or WAV) with the cover art, title, artist, album, year, and track number written straight into the file's tags. No Spotify account, no API keys, no separate FFmpeg install, and nothing that requires a terminal unless you want one."],"features":["Playlists, albums, and single tracks. Paste a normal link, an intl-xx locale link, or a spotify: URI copied from the desktop app. Each playlist or album downloads into its own folder.","Five audio formats. MP3, M4A, Opus (lossy at 128 / 192 / 256 / 320 kbps) and FLAC / WAV (lossless). Your choice is remembered between sessions.","Real metadata, written correctly. Title, artist(s), album, year, and track number are embedded for every format, with the front cover art baked in. MP3 tags are written for maximum player compatibility, so artwork and…","Per-track cover art. Each song gets its own artwork, not one shared playlist cover.","Parallel downloads. Multiple songs download at once, so a playlist finishes much faster, with a cooperative Stop that takes effect immediately."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sunnypatell/sunnify-spotify-downloader/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1dad503eb95e8cfb3cb347c0297921e325f4f079d7d743caa8a4d0802be1f85c","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:02.629Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:02.629Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Free, open source, cross-platform. Point-and-click desktop app with a built-in headless CLI. No account, no subscription.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sunnypatell/sunnify-spotify-downloader/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No account, no subscription.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sunnypatell/sunnify-spotify-downloader/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"No Spotify account, no API keys, no separate FFmpeg install, and nothing that requires a terminal unless you want one.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sunnypatell/sunnify-spotify-downloader/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"No Spotify account, no API keys, no separate FFmpeg install, and nothing that requires a terminal unless you want one.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sunnypatell/sunnify-spotify-downloader/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"The app is ad-hoc signed but not notarized (notarization needs a paid Apple Developer account; thi